exports[`subscription images > uses JSON generation with OAuth headers and stores verbatim original before preview 2`] = `"Generate or edit an image using the signed-in Codex subscription only when the user requests image output. For a new image omit referenceImages. For an edit, supply complete attachment IDs copied from selected session image blocks or read_image results. Never replace an invalid edit with a new generation. The result includes a preview and the original PNG host path when available; copy, do not move, the original if saving to the workspace. Do not silently retry a failed request or switch models: requests can consume subscription quota."`;

